---
// privacy-policy.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { ShieldCheck, Lock, EyeOff } from 'lucide-react';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy – Toolivo"
  description="Learn how Toolivo protects your privacy. 100% browser-based processing, zero file retention, and no personal data collection."
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 5rem;">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />

    <article style="max-width: 820px; margin: 2rem auto;">
      <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <span class="badge badge-success" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
          <ShieldCheck size={14} /> Privacy-First Architecture
        </span>
        <h1 style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem;">Last updated: October 1, 2026</p>
      </header>

      <div class="blog-content" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-secondary);">
        <h2>1. Core Commitment: Zero File Retention</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>Toolivo</strong>, we believe file utility websites should never spy on or retain user documents. 
          The fundamental architecture of Toolivo is designed so that <strong>your files are never uploaded to our servers</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          All image compression, PDF merging, format transcoding, text counting, QR code generation, and data transformations execute locally inside your web browser’s memory using client-side JavaScript, WebAssembly, and HTML5 Canvas APIs.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Information We Do NOT Collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We do <strong>not</strong> collect, view, or store the contents of your uploaded photos, documents, or texts.</li>
          <li>We do <strong>not</strong> require you to register, log in, or provide your name, phone number, or address.</li>
          <li>We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or trade user data to third parties, data brokers, or AI model trainers.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Analytics and Performance</h2>
        <p>
          To maintain high availability and evaluate which tools are most useful, we track basic anonymous aggregated events (e.g. "image-compressor launched", "file downloaded") stored locally in your browser storage. We do not use intrusive fingerprinting or invasive cross-site trackers.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Advertising Transparency</h2>
        <p>
          To support free access to our tools, we may display standardized, non-intrusive banner advertisements through certified advertising networks like Google AdSense. These networks may use non-sensitive contextual cookies to serve relevant ads. You may manage cookie preferences in your browser at any time.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Contact Us Regarding Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our client-side sandboxing, please contact us at <a href="/contact/">our contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
